554442868_4620760491231566657_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DX6skNNaXy4Q7kNvwGguaxL&_nc_oc=AdlJ7zBnDIVKrQ2C3tyK3MdAFw43oCluqQqnWGt-kmfs30unHa_o3-3viHHhaSON2gQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfytwFuu1IUk0p9xBOQRc8WEAnxqJBmV1wOy20wLKDKNBQ&oe=69BE846C"}, {"file_name": "capture 1.png", "id": "783698660711990", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_783698664045323_5210865340295355557_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n8uV3mEY3O0Q7kNvwHPGVBU&_nc_oc=AdlwnJ6T251Ixng9Q92HVQ7zIR8ZRNl2Gye4HDzK0hI1p9w7EQFgKQzW4ARf8R96J8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz9tdKddm-Ft-Vm4pikqyedGbdzqDeH_AJASRA0F53glA&oe=69BE8733"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CM StoRE - couverture paysage.png", "id": "1415640733376481", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822863_1415640736709814_2754899795012134397_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4_mmKUzk5wQ7kNvwGR-1lH&_nc_oc=AdlhHX7HzvXaxmZp81uURwe9V12noQiadGXfZCN5688qfbIqV1Q-wdJtxFVSmL6pRp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwMkHvjoHe7khkMmubjz00YofWoHImy4nqhOI8NJRzZtQ&oe=69BE857C"}, "display_name": "Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha", "keywords": ["combat", "magic", "crepe", "spell", "action"], "long_description": "# Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha is a fun solo adventure in magical girl style! Become a Cr\u00eape Goddess and protect earth against an alien army!\n\n# Features: \n\n1. BONK WITH YOUR MAGICAL PAN: Mix heavy and light hits,break guards, and take back the stolen ingredients! \n{1401849871406732}\n\n2. CRAFT SPELLS WITH INGREDIENTS: To cast spells you have to craft them prior. Enter a Crepo-Trance, grab the right ingredients, and mix up cr\u00eapes at a lightning speed. Unleash them later in battle with a pose!\n{793123986817059}\n\n3. MAGICAL GIRL POSE: Pose like a true Magical Girl to summon your freshly cooked cr\u00eapes and cast powerful spells. Just move your arms and fire them off!\n{894263426315476}\n\n# YOUR STORY: YOU ARE A CR\u00caPE GODDESS HANA\u2026.\n\nIn the far reaches of space, a tyrant has sworn to destroy the Cr\u00eape, the universal symbol of joy and community. \n\nOn Earth, an ordinary student finds a ruby-studded pan and, by cooking the best cr\u00eape in the universe, awakens the powers of the Cr\u00eape Goddess!\n\nShe then learns a shocking secret: our planet is actually a cr\u00eape\u2026 and therefore flat. If the Cr\u00eape is destroyed, the world will fall with it....\n\n-> If you like the concept and want to support development (or just share cr\u00eape memes), join our Discord community and give us your feedback! \nhttps://discord.com/invite/8qcQHspEAr\n\n\n", "short_description": "Cr\u00eape Master! is a fast and crazy combat game where you fight like a magical girl. Become the Cr\u00eape Goddess, smash aliens with your magical pan and cast cr\u00eape-powered spells by striking real magical girl poses with your arms.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/cm_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hallucinations-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "